            "description": {
              "value": "To protect the knowledge within your mind from intrusion or erasure, you ward yourself against a mental attack, temporarily delaying its effects. Until the end of your next turn, you ignore a single mental effect that meets the requirement.\n\nYou can suppress a particular effect using Ward Mind or Cognitive Loophole (Core Rulebook 188) only once, even if you have both feats."
